er, Vereign</div> </div> <span class=" proof-quote-brand" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>HIN</span> </figcaption> <span class="mono proof-quote-link" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>↗ Read the case study</span> </a><a class="proof-quote" href="https://simplepage.eth.link/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <div class="proof-quote-usecase" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>Resilient publishing</div> <blockquote class="proof-quote-text" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>“IPFS gave us a content-addressed foundation for publishing to the web, so our users can host and share sites that stay online without depending on any single server, and without the clunky UX that usually comes with decentralization.”</blockquote> <figcaption class="proof-quote-cap" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <img class="proof-avatar proof-avatar-photo" src="/portraits/joel-thorstensson.webp" alt="Joel Thorstensson" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <div data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <div class="proof-quote-who" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>Joel Thorstensson</div> <div class="proof-quote-role" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>SimplePage</div> </div> <span class=" proof-quote-brand" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>SimplePage</span> </figcaption> <span class="mono proof-quote-link" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>↗ Visit SimplePage</span> </a><a class="proof-quote" href="https://docs.ipfs.tech/case-studies/snapshot/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <div class="proof-quote-usecase" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>Resilient publishing</div> <blockquote class="proof-quote-text" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>“IPFS is the standard for storing data in a verifiable and fully transparent way, thereby allowing us to build openly auditable governance systems.”</blockquote> <figcaption class="proof-quote-cap" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <div class="proof-avatar" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>F</div> <div data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3> <div class="proof-quote-who" data-astro-cid-bcts4zk3>Fabien</div> <div class="proof-quote-role" data-astro